WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:33.958
After describing sattva Guna in
the previous verses,

2
00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:35.791
Lord Krishna now describes Rajo Guna

3
00:00:35.791 --> 00:00:37.958
in verse 14.7.

4
00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:40.291
The core tendency of Rajo Guna is

5
00:00:40.291 --> 00:00:44.291
limitless desires and constant action.

6
00:00:44.291 --> 00:00:46.791
It keeps the jivatma perpetually engaged

7
00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:49.291
and multiplies its cravings.

8
00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:52.208
Although a person driven by Rajo Guna

9
00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:54.625
appears active and industrious,

10
00:00:54.625 --> 00:00:56.458
this very tendency

11
00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:59.791
binds them to the outcomes of their actions.

12
00:00:59.791 --> 00:01:01.250
In this way, Rajo Guna,

13
00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:03.250
through desire and attachment

14
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.208
to the fruits of action,

15
00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:07.250
pulls the jivatma ever deeper

16
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.041
into the bondages of the material world.

17
00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:18.000
Lord Krishna describes Rajo Guna
as ragatmaka –

18
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.750
filled with passion and craving.

19
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:22.875
This guna awakens in a person

20
00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:28.000
an intense longing for what they do not have,

21
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.916
and a tendency to cling

22
00:01:29.916 --> 00:01:32.666
to what they do.

23
00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:35.833
These very desires keep the jivatma perpetually

24
00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:39.208
seeking material pleasures and achievements.

25
00:01:39.208 --> 00:01:43.666
It becomes caught in the race for
wealth, fame, position,

26
00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:45.208
and indulgence.

27
00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:47.625
This is why Lord Krishna says –

28
00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:49.375
Rajo Guna binds the jivatma

29
00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:52.791
through attachment to the fruits of action.

30
00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:54.125
A person under its influence

31
00:01:54.125 --> 00:01:56.291
is absorbed in preserving

32
00:01:56.291 --> 00:01:59.125
what they have and constantly

33
00:01:59.125 --> 00:02:00.250
striving to get

34
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:03.708
what they do not.

35
00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:06.708
For example – one who has a large house

36
00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:10.791
spends day and night maintaining it,
while simultaneously

37
00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:14.083
desiring an even larger one.

38
00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:15.750
Life thus becomes a cycle

39
00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:19.708
of endless effort and struggle.

40
00:02:19.708 --> 00:02:22.208
People work hard

41
00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.708
to fulfil desires.

42
00:02:23.708 --> 00:02:26.375
This brings momentary satisfaction,

43
00:02:26.375 --> 00:02:30.583
but deepens the attachment further.

44
00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:35.041
A person under Rajo Guna seeks
respect in society,

45
00:02:35.041 --> 00:02:37.000
craves recognition,

46
00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:42.708
and constantly struggles for a
comfortable family life.

47
00:02:42.708 --> 00:02:45.583
In today’s world, success is often measured

48
00:02:45.583 --> 00:02:46.791
by wealth,

49
00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:49.666
power, and fame.

50
00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:51.375
A person’s worth is assessed

51
00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:53.458
by their professional achievements,

52
00:02:53.458 --> 00:02:57.875
social standing, and financial position.

53
00:02:57.875 --> 00:02:59.666
This very outlook pushes people

54
00:02:59.666 --> 00:03:03.625
into a blind race toward material goals,

55
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:07.500
and their spiritual progress stops.

56
00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.666
Lord Krishna warns

57
00:03:09.666 --> 00:03:12.666
that Rajo Guna is not the path to liberation.

58
00:03:12.666 --> 00:03:13.666
It deepens

59
00:03:13.666 --> 00:03:18.083
the cycle of birth and death,

60
00:03:18.083 --> 00:03:21.250
because it binds the soul to endless desires

61
00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:24.375
and actions.

62
00:03:24.375 --> 00:03:25.708
In the world’s eyes

63
00:03:25.708 --> 00:03:29.000
such a person may appear successful,

64
00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.583
but within

65
00:03:30.583 --> 00:03:33.916
they remain entangled in material bondage,

66
00:03:33.916 --> 00:03:38.208
far from true spiritual liberation.

67
00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:47.583
Have you noticed that people today consider

68
00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:49.875
‘I am very busy’

69
00:03:49.875 --> 00:03:52.750
something to be proud of?

70
00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.916
But pause and think –

71
00:03:54.916 --> 00:03:58.166
what exactly is this busyness about?

72
00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:00.000
Most of this busyness

73
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.000
does not come from a meaningful purpose,

74
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:07.041
but from Rajo Guna.

75
00:04:07.041 --> 00:04:09.791
It is a restlessness –

76
00:04:09.791 --> 00:04:14.541
one that generates craving and attachment.

77
00:04:14.541 --> 00:04:20.166
You think you are working hard to
build the future.

78
00:04:20.166 --> 00:04:23.500
But look deeper –

79
00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:28.916
are you working from the heart,

80
00:04:28.916 --> 00:04:32.625
or is the fear of being left behind,

81
00:04:32.625 --> 00:04:36.333
the need to prove yourself,

82
00:04:36.333 --> 00:04:39.750
and the hunger for more the force driving you?

83
00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:44.000
This is the trap of Rajo Guna.

84
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.250
It makes you believe

85
00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:49.291
that unless you are running,

86
00:04:49.291 --> 00:04:52.083
you are not succeeding.

87
00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:57.250
But is every race a form of progress?

88
00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:58.500
Sometimes

89
00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:01.583
you keep running endlessly.

90
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:05.541
Your heart is full of craving

91
00:05:05.541 --> 00:05:11.125
and actions are done only out of
attachment to results.

92
00:05:11.125 --> 00:05:13.250
Then peace becomes

93
00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:18.041
a distant dream.

94
00:05:18.041 --> 00:05:20.000
You remain busy

95
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:23.000
on the outside, but

96
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.000
within, restless, anxious,

97
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.166
and unfulfilled.

98
00:05:29.166 --> 00:05:32.208
So pause and ask –

99
00:05:32.208 --> 00:05:34.875
what are you busy with?

100
00:05:34.875 --> 00:05:37.416
Is it truly meaningful, or

101
00:05:37.416 --> 00:05:41.000
only a reaction to society’s expectations?

102
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:45.500
True happiness does not lie in
‘always being busy.’

103
00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.166
It comes

104
00:05:47.166 --> 00:05:50.666
when your actions arise from clarity,

105
00:05:50.666 --> 00:05:52.916
not compulsion.

106
00:05:52.916 --> 00:05:56.958
Walk slowly. Check your direction.

107
00:05:56.958 --> 00:06:00.625
Make sure you are not climbing a
ladder of success

108
00:06:00.625 --> 00:06:04.375
only to find

109
00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:08.333
it was leaning against the wrong wall.

110
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:10.250
Reflect on this.

111
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.791
Have you seen how today’s society

112
00:06:18.791 --> 00:06:21.000
endlessly

113
00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.250
praises ambition?

114
00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:26.875
Bigger homes, newer things, higher positions –

115
00:06:26.875 --> 00:06:31.125
this chain never stops.

116
00:06:31.125 --> 00:06:34.333
Today even dissatisfaction

117
00:06:34.333 --> 00:06:37.375
has been renamed ‘the desire for progress.’

118
00:06:37.375 --> 00:06:39.166
But these limitless desires –

119
00:06:39.166 --> 00:06:42.500
for wealth, comfort, and respect –

120
00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:46.041
however they may be

121
00:06:46.041 --> 00:06:50.000
dressed up –

122
00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:53.916
are the invisible ropes

123
00:06:53.916 --> 00:06:58.125
of Rajo Guna.

124
00:06:58.125 --> 00:07:00.958
When this guna dominates in a family,

125
00:07:00.958 --> 00:07:05.958
peace quietly slips out the door.

126
00:07:05.958 --> 00:07:08.333
Everyone is running, but

127
00:07:08.333 --> 00:07:11.291
no one is truly arriving anywhere.

128
00:07:11.291 --> 00:07:12.708
When preparing children

129
00:07:12.708 --> 00:07:16.541
for competitive examinations, remember

130
00:07:16.541 --> 00:07:19.458
that the purpose should be to
give them the right direction

131
00:07:19.458 --> 00:07:23.083
and a genuine opportunity to grow in life –

132
00:07:23.083 --> 00:07:25.083
not merely

133
00:07:25.083 --> 00:07:29.041
to win a small race against the
children next door.

134
00:07:29.041 --> 00:07:32.666
Parents rush to give their children

135
00:07:32.666 --> 00:07:35.583
‘the best.’

136
00:07:35.583 --> 00:07:37.750
But they forget

137
00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:41.041
that the greatest treasure for a child

138
00:07:41.041 --> 00:07:43.791
is not luxury –

139
00:07:43.791 --> 00:07:48.541
but love, togetherness, and inner stability.

140
00:07:48.541 --> 00:07:51.958
Children absorb this restlessness.

141
00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:56.791
They begin to believe their worth lies only

142
00:07:56.791 --> 00:07:59.958
in what they ‘achieve.’

143
00:07:59.958 --> 00:08:01.791
Think –

144
00:08:01.791 --> 00:08:05.750
if the heart stays bound by limitless desires,

145
00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:10.333
always submerged in comparison and craving,

146
00:08:10.333 --> 00:08:15.541
can it ever truly be free?

147
00:08:15.541 --> 00:08:16.833
Rajo Guna

148
00:08:16.833 --> 00:08:20.208
does not show its invisible chains.

149
00:08:20.208 --> 00:08:23.000
But the moment you think

150
00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:27.250
‘now I have everything,’

151
00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:31.291
it binds even tighter.

152
00:08:31.291 --> 00:08:34.541
True family strength lies not

153
00:08:34.541 --> 00:08:36.791
in how much you have,

154
00:08:36.791 --> 00:08:40.000
but in how

155
00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:44.250
content, connected, and centred you are.

156
00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.500
So guide your family –

157
00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.166
teach them to live

158
00:08:49.166 --> 00:08:53.375
with meaningful purpose, free from pressure.

159
00:08:58.083 --> 00:09:01.291
Ambition is not your enemy.

160
00:09:01.291 --> 00:09:03.875
When it is purposeful,

161
00:09:03.875 --> 00:09:07.791
it can become a beautiful force.

162
00:09:07.791 --> 00:09:09.250
But think –

163
00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.750
where is your ambition

164
00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.541
getting its energy?

165
00:09:13.541 --> 00:09:17.375
Is it a calm and clear desire –

166
00:09:17.375 --> 00:09:20.708
to grow and to contribute?

167
00:09:20.708 --> 00:09:24.708
Or is it a deep restlessness –

168
00:09:24.708 --> 00:09:26.041
filled with unfulfilled craving,

169
00:09:26.041 --> 00:09:30.791
comparison, and hunger for recognition?

170
00:09:30.791 --> 00:09:35.000
If it is restlessness, understand –

171
00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.666
you are working under the
influence of Rajo Guna.

172
00:09:38.666 --> 00:09:39.708
This energy

173
00:09:39.708 --> 00:09:42.916
will push you to work hard.

174
00:09:42.916 --> 00:09:44.708
You may even appear successful

175
00:09:44.708 --> 00:09:46.708
in the world’s eyes.

176
00:09:46.708 --> 00:09:49.125
But notice –

177
00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:51.625
the more you gain,

178
00:09:51.625 --> 00:09:55.458
the more the race for even more begins.

179
00:09:55.458 --> 00:09:57.833
There is no end to it.

180
00:09:57.833 --> 00:10:00.500
Remember – balance in life

181
00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:03.250
is not only about managing time.

182
00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:06.541
It is also about managing desires.

183
00:10:06.541 --> 00:10:09.666
I see this –

184
00:10:09.666 --> 00:10:11.708
you grow tired.

185
00:10:11.708 --> 00:10:15.000
Not from working, but from

186
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:19.041
endlessly running under the pressure
of material ambition.

187
00:10:19.041 --> 00:10:21.916
You try to fill the emptiness within

188
00:10:21.916 --> 00:10:25.416
with professional achievements.

189
00:10:25.416 --> 00:10:30.416
But the soul is never satisfied by them.

190
00:10:30.416 --> 00:10:33.916
So lift your ambition toward higher

191
00:10:33.916 --> 00:10:37.791
purposes and contribution.

192
00:10:37.791 --> 00:10:40.166
Do not exhaust yourself

193
00:10:40.166 --> 00:10:43.250
in the endless race of material desires.

194
00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:46.166
Pause. Reflect –

195
00:10:46.166 --> 00:10:51.791
are you working with clarity, or
with compulsion?

196
00:10:51.791 --> 00:10:53.875
Keep your ambitions –

197
00:10:53.875 --> 00:10:55.333
but keep them

198
00:10:55.333 --> 00:10:58.541
free and balanced.

199
00:10:58.541 --> 00:11:02.958
Then this very energy will bring you closer to Me.

200
00:11:02.958 --> 00:11:04.416
Reflect on this.
